  message: "DONE in v8 (PR merged @ 0d740169bf). Deleted the py.py:2367-2368 branch routing kind=method through make_route_stable_id(verb, class_name); HTTP-verb CBV methods now flow through the file-anchored make_typed_stable_id/_compute_stable_id path (containing_stable_id=parent class id). BEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE: flask-restful HelloWorld.get cross-file pair (test_api.py vs test_api_with_blueprint.py) no longer collides — flask-restful corpus collisions 7->0 in the gate re-run. The dead HTTP_METHODS constant removed. 3 Django/flask CBV tests still pass (route-verb signal lives on separate kind=route nodes)."  # c93d
